11. WHOIS terms of use
   Files:   tests/whois_terms/
   These files are copies of the terms of use that WHOIS servers send with their
   answers. Each text belongs to the registry or registrar that publishes it. A
   weekly workflow compares each server's current terms with its copy. A change in
   the terms fails the workflow, so a person reads the new terms.
